        <mxCell id="gLyNCSbUXngHBsU6SomW-1" value="1. User clicks on upload document button&lt;div&gt;2. Select files&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. FE fetches the pre-signed url and Files uploaded to blob storage directly&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. Once uploaded, call the backend API with file&#39;s metadata(blob url, name, type, size, etc.)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;5. BE creates a record in database and kicks off the parsing job&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;6. Once parsing is complete, parser calls a webhook with results&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;7. the parsed document is ingested(chunked, metadata) into the vector database&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
